---
/**
 * Boot loader — the ORCAS mark is the loading state, not a spinner.
 * Ring draws in, waves ripple, the mark surfaces, then the wordmark and
 * progress readout fade in. Runs once on first visit; transition:persist
 * keeps this exact (already-finished) node across client-side navigation
 * so it never replays.
 */
